{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cut The Grass</strong> is not your typical mowing game.<br>By day, explore fields full of tall grass and hidden loot. Gather resources, sell them at your farm, and buy upgrades. But when night falls... the monsters come.<br>Defend your farm from waves of enemies, upgrade your weapons, and try to survive just one more night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cycle becomes harder. The farther you go from your farm, the better the loot\u2014but also the greater the risk. Work together or die trying.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mow the grass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot and sell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the horde.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the endless night?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864710?t=1759846952","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864710?t=1759846952","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864710/04be5d8600e7abf6192ee99fc14b8defa5bea07f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759846952","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864710/04be5d8600e7abf6192ee99fc14b8defa5bea07f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759846952","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cut The Grass</strong> is not your typical mowing game.<br>By day, explore fields full of tall grass and hidden loot. Gather resources, sell them at your farm, and buy upgrades. But when night falls... the monsters come.<br>Defend your farm from waves of enemies, upgra